  "goodToKnow": "Das Korsett is a corset, a tight undergarment shaping the waist, and in medicine a back brace. Figuratively, ein enges Korsett is a restrictive set of rules: das Korsett der Schuldenbremse, ein finanzielles Korsett. Synonym for the garment: das Mieder. It comes from French corset (little body). Plural: die Korsetts or Korsette."
